From 3eb7389e8a620fa4c4eca339bebc881f6b334931 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wuqingabc <wuqingabc@hotmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Mar 2026 15:44:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] [winamz] fix: resolve runtime errors found during
 integration testing
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Four categories of bugs fixed (all consistent with original design):

1. Slonik sql tagged template literal (agents.ts, grants.ts, audit.ts)
   - Rewrote all raw SQL strings to use sql`` tagged template literals
   - Required by @silverhand/slonik which rejects raw string queries
   - Behavior unchanged; dynamic WHERE uses sql.join(), arrays use sql.array()

2. koaPagination totalCount pattern (agents.ts, grants.ts, audit.ts)
   - Backend: set ctx.pagination.totalCount instead of returning {total, items}
   - Frontend: read Total-Number response header instead of response.json().total
   - Follows Logto pagination convention; response body is now a plain array

3. Console API path prefix fix (Agents.tsx, Grants.tsx, Audit.tsx)
   - Changed winamz/agents → api/winamz/agents (and grants, audit)
   - Console resolves paths against tenantEndpoint (http://localhost:4001/)
   - All three pages now reach the correct management API endpoint

4. DB migration: add RLS + GRANT statements (winamz-001-create-tables.ts)
   - Added ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY + permissive policy on all 3 tables
   - Added GRANT SELECT/INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE to logto_tenant_logto role
   - Without this, fresh deployments fail at startup (RLS check) and at
     runtime (permission denied for tenant DB user)
   - Empty-table placeholder: replaced DynamicT (missing i18n key) with
     plain string literals

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
